---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const docs = `${base}/docs/quickstart/`;
const repo = import.meta.env.GITHUB_REPOSITORY || 'ucgeorge/switchboard';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="Put MCP-connected agents behind an OpenAI-compatible endpoint. A local-first Go binary with a durable queue, live dashboard, OAuth, and remote CLI."/><title>Switchboard — your agents, behind one API</title><link rel="icon" href={`${base}/favicon.svg`}/></head>
<body>
<a href="#main" class="skip">Skip to content</a>
<header><a class="brand" href={`${base}/`}><i></i>Switchboard</a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href={`${base}/docs/introduction/`}>Documentation</a><a href={`https://github.com/${repo}`}>GitHub ↗</a><a class="button small" href={docs}>Get started</a></nav></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero">
 <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Open source · MIT · One Go binary</div>
 <h1>Your agents.<br/>Behind <em>one API.</em></h1>
 <p class="lede">Give any OpenAI-compatible app access to the agents you already use. Switchboard queues the request. An agent claims it over MCP. Your app gets the answer.</p>
 <div class="actions"><a class="button" href={docs}>Run your first request <span>→</span></a><a class="secondary" href={`${base}/docs/concepts/`}>Understand the flow ↗</a></div>
 <div class="install"><span class="prompt">$</span><code>go install github.com/ucgeorge/switchboard/cmd/switchboard@latest</code><button aria-label="Copy install command" id="copy">Copy</button></div>
 <p class="install-note">Go 1.26.3+ · Prefer a binary? <a href={`${base}/docs/installation/`}>Install without Go</a></p>
</section>
<section class="flow" aria-label="Request flow"><div><small>01 / CALL</small><h3>Your application</h3><code>POST /v1/chat/completions</code><p>Same SDK. Your own base URL.</p></div><span class="arrow">→</span><div class="core"><small>02 / ROUTE</small><h3>Switchboard</h3><code>SQLite or PostgreSQL</code><p>Authenticated, visible, recoverable.</p></div><span class="arrow">→</span><div><small>03 / ANSWER</small><h3>Your agent</h3><code>claim → stream → complete</code><p>Claude Code, MCP clients, or you.</p></div></section>
<section class="preview"><div class="preview-heading"><span class="eyebrow">EVERY REQUEST HAS A STORY</span><h2>See the whole path.</h2><p>Which app asked. Which agent answered. Where the time went.</p></div><div class="browser"><div class="bar"><b>● ● ●</b><span>Switchboard / Overview</span><span class="live">● Live</span></div><img src={`${base}/screenshots/overview.png`} alt="Switchboard overview showing queue depth, active channels, latency, and recent requests" width="1440" height="2217" loading="lazy"/></div><a class="text-link" href={`${base}/docs/dashboard/`}>Explore the operator dashboard →</a></section>
<section class="features"><div><span class="eyebrow">A SMALL TOOL, A USEFUL BRIDGE</span><h2>Built for the gap<br/>between apps and agents.</h2></div><div class="feature-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Bring the agent you have</h3><p>An MCP-connected agent becomes the model behind your application's chat endpoint. Define model patterns and add more channels when you need capacity.</p><a href={`${base}/docs/mcp/`}>Connect an agent →</a></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Keep work recoverable</h3><p>Atomic claims, deadlines, leases, and bounded retries keep requests moving. Partial streamed answers are never retried as a second answer.</p><a href={`${base}/docs/lifecycle/`}>Request lifecycle →</a></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Operate from anywhere</h3><p>Use the dashboard or an authenticated remote CLI. Create keys, inspect channels, answer a request, and download a database backup.</p><a href={`${base}/docs/remote/`}>Remote operation →</a></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Stay in the loop yourself</h3><p>Inspect exactly what an app sends, then answer manually while testing prompts or building a prototype. The caller receives a normal response.</p><a href={`${base}/docs/human-in-the-loop/`}>Answer manually →</a></article></div></section>
<section class="cta"><div><span class="eyebrow">START LOCAL. CONNECT WHAT YOU NEED.</span><h2>A queue, an agent,<br/>and your first answer.</h2><p>The quickstart takes you through the entire round trip, including a manual answer when no agent is connected.</p></div><a class="button" href={docs}>Open the quickstart →</a></section>
</main><footer><a class="brand" href={`${base}/`}><i></i>Switchboard</a><p>Open source under MIT. Built with Go, HTMX, SQLite/PostgreSQL &amp; sqlc.</p><div><a href={`${base}/third-party-notices.txt`}>Licenses</a><a href={`${base}/docs/security/`}>Security</a><a href={`${base}/docs/contributing/`}>Contribute</a><a href={`https://github.com/${repo}`}>Source</a></div></footer>
<script>document.getElementById('copy')?.addEventListener('click',async function(){try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText('go install github.com/ucgeorge/switchboard/cmd/switchboard@latest');this.textContent='Copied';setTimeout(()=>{this.textContent='Copy'},1500)}catch{this.textContent='Select text'}});</script>
</body></html>
<style>
:global(*){box-sizing:border-box} :global(html){scroll-behavior:smooth} :global(body){margin:0;background:#0b0e14;color:#e7edf4;font:16px/1.65 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif} :global(a){color:inherit;text-decoration:none} :global(a:focus-visible),:global(button:focus-visible){outline:2px solid #f5b942;outline-offset:6px} .skip{position:absolute;top:-80px}.skip:focus{top:8px;z-index:10;background:#f5b942;color:#151009;padding:10px} header,footer{max-width:1240px;margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:24px 32px;gap:24px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.035em;font-size:21px}.brand i{width:11px;height:11px;background:#f5b942;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 20px #f5b94270} nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;font-size:14px;color:#aab6c6} .button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;background:#f5b942;color:#1b1508;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:650;font-size:15px}.button:hover{background:#ffcb60}.button.small{padding:8px 14px;font-size:13px} main{max-width:1176px;margin:auto} .hero{padding:86px 0 66px;max-width:850px}.eyebrow{color:#a8b5c6;font-size:11px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.eyebrow span{width:6px;height:6px;background:#73dca6;border-radius:50%} h1{font-size:clamp(48px,6.8vw,88px);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.065em;line-height:1.05;margin:24px 0} h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#f5b942} .lede{color:#aebbc9;max-width:690px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.7} .actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;margin:32px 0}.secondary{font-size:14px;color:#c6d0dc}.install{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:#111722;border:1px solid #242d3a;border-radius:9px;max-width:800px;padding:14px 16px;overflow:auto}.prompt{color:#f5b942} code{font:12px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;white-space:nowrap}.install button{margin-left:auto;color:#bac6d5;background:#1a2431;border:1px solid #303b4b;border-radius:5px;padding:5px 10px;cursor:pointer}.install-note{font-size:12px;color:#79899d}.install-note a{color:#b8c7d8;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px} .flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #25303d;border-bottom:1px solid #25303d;padding:28px 0;gap:24px}.flow small{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace;color:#8292a7}.flow h3{margin:8px 0;font-size:19px}.flow p{margin:6px 0;color:#8f9fb3;font-size:13px}.flow code{color:#c3cfde}.core{padding:20px;background:#171c25;border:1px solid #755723;border-radius:10px}.core small{color:#f5b942}.arrow{color:#78899d} .preview{padding:78px 0}.preview-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:center;column-gap:30px}.preview-heading .eyebrow{grid-column:1/-1} h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.8vw,44px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:12px 0 28px}.preview-heading p{color:#95a6bb;max-width:380px;margin-left:auto}.browser{border:1px solid #293341;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;height:580px;box-shadow:0 20px 70px #0006}.bar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px;padding:13px 18px;background:#141b25;color:#95a4b7;border-bottom:1px solid #293341}.bar b{color:#4f5c6f;letter-spacing:4px}.live{color:#73dca6}.browser img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.text-link{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-top:18px;color:#f5b942}.features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.65fr;gap:68px;padding:30px 0 80px}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px}article{padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #293341}article>span{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace;color:#f5b942}article h3{font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:12px 0}article p{font-size:14px;color:#91a1b5;line-height:1.8}article a{font-size:12px;color:#d6deea}.cta{border-top:1px solid #293341;border-bottom:1px solid #293341;padding:54px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px}.cta p{color:#96a6b9;max-width:570px;font-size:15px}.cta h2{margin-bottom:20px}footer{font-size:12px;color:#8495aa;padding-block:40px}footer .brand{font-size:16px}footer div{display:flex;gap:22px}footer p{margin:0} @media(max-width:900px){main{padding:0 24px}.hero{padding-top:50px}.features{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.browser{height:400px}.flow{gap:12px}.flow code{font-size:10px}}@media(max-width:600px){header,footer{padding:20px 24px}nav{gap:16px}nav .small{display:none}main{padding:0 20px}.hero{padding:50px 0 40px}.lede{font-size:17px}.actions{gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}.arrow{display:none}.flow>div{padding:16px}.preview{padding:48px 0}.preview-heading{display:block}.preview-heading p{margin:0 0 24px}.browser{height:260px}.feature-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.features{padding-bottom:40px}.cta{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}footer{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}h1{font-size:56px}}
</style>
